      },
      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/2958-wide-lines\n\nConflicts with #2818 (display modes, PR from main):\n- viewport.rs: keep main's hidden-edge shader stage, counts() and the\n  draw_list::plan loop; its pipelines now come from viewport/pipes.rs\n  (the hidden-edge pipeline added there, built for the sample count).\n- app/view.rs, state_view.rs: keep both sides' fields (display, show_grid\n  and line_width, antialias); one persist_view writes all of them.\n- app/tests/view_file.rs: main's new literal takes ..ViewPrefs::default().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
